	(text "SENSOR CIRCUIT GOES HERE (non-isolated). Not drawn yet.\nNets: VSENS (switched 3.0 V, 100 mA max), GND, VBAT (raw battery, behind the enabled buck-boost only),\nSENS_TX (CN1 pin 6, host TX out -> sensor RX), SENS_RX (CN1 pin 7, host RX in <- sensor TX).\nSensor connector on the x = 90 short edge."
